title: $:/mf/gen/Panel/duplicates panel
catalog: Panel
target: duplicates panel
summary: The duplicates panel type

!! Commands

* ``duplicates:find`` — Duplicates: jump to a group or a copy by name
* ``duplicates:first`` — Duplicates: move to the first row
* ``duplicates:keep`` — Duplicates: keep the copy under the cursor, trash the others
* ``duplicates:last`` — Duplicates: move to the last row
* ``duplicates:next`` — Duplicates: move down
* ``duplicates:prev`` — Duplicates: move up
* ``duplicates:refresh`` — Duplicates: reload the groups
* ``duplicates:toggle`` — Duplicates: expand or collapse the group under the cursor
* ``duplicates:trash`` — Duplicates: send the copy under the cursor to the trash
